    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000ql02](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000ql02) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 81.191 depth occurred on Jun 18 2025 31km SW of Usulután. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 13.0931 longitude -88.5664. It impacted 324483 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
